# Editable sources and build machinery for the milestone PDF packs.
#
# The PDFs in docs/MX_*/ are the deliverables. These are the Markdown they are
# generated from, plus the pandoc template, print stylesheet and build script.
# They are kept locally so the packs can be rebuilt, but publishing them put a
# second copy of every figure in the repository with nothing keeping the two in
# step -- and a reviewer reading the Markdown could get a different answer than
# one reading the PDF.
docs/*_source/
